al equation. In this case, we have\n\n$$\np(x)=- e^{x},\\quad q(x)=5 \\cdot x^{2},\\quad n=5.\n$$\n\n- Equation III is a Bernoulli differential equation. In this case, we have\n\n$$\np(x)=2 \\cdot \\log{\\left(x \\right)},\\quad q(x)=- 2 \\cdot x,\\quad n=3.\n$$\n\nTherefore, select II, III." 13194139538755 17592186045443 true] [17592186673325 1080 "true" 13194139538755 17592186045443 true] [17592186673325 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139538755 17592186045443 true] [17592186673325 1083 #uuid "e7ee5673-0a5d-5123-830b-50503df0d6bf" 13194139538755 17592186045443 true] [17592186673326 1080 "false" 13194139538755 17592186045443 true] [17592186673326 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139538755 17592186045443 true] [17592186673326 1083 #uuid "e913d5fd-2f01-5ecf-a897-63fed49b930c" 13194139538755 17592186045443 true] [17592186673327 1075 #edb/ref 17592186673294 13194139538755 17592186045443 true] [17592186673327 1075 #edb/ref 17592186673318 13194139538755 17592186045443 true] [17592186673327 1076 #edb/ref 17592186408166 13194139538755 17592186045443 true] [17592186673327 1077 "II" 13194139538755 17592186045443 true] [17592186673327 1078 #edb/ref 17592186673294 13194139538755 17592186045443 true] [17592186673327 1079 #uuid "e9f70a37-68e3-594b-a529-75a57129f8f2" 13194139538755 17592186045443 true] [17592186673328 1075 #edb/ref 17592186673295 13194139538755 17592186045443 true] [17592186673328 1075 #edb/ref 17592186673330 13194139538755 17592186045443 true] [17592186673328 1076 #edb/ref 17592186408166 13194139538755 17592186045443 true] [17592186673328 1077 "III" 13194139538755 17592186045443 true] [17592186673328 1078 #edb/ref 17592186673295 13194139538755 17592186045443 true] [17592186673328 1079 #uuid "f28f64b6-0945-576e-993a-ff64ebcb50a6" 13194139538755 17592186045443 true] [17592186673329 1080 "II and III only" 13194139538755 17592186045443 true] [17592186673329 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139538755 17592186045443 true] [17592186673329 1083 #uuid "f3118d21-2cfb-